        },
        {
          "text": "Pia akampa na nakili ya andiko la mbiu ya kuwaangamiza, iliyotangazwa Shushani, ili amwonyeshe Esta, na kumweleza; tena amwagize aingie kwa mfalme, kumsihi na kuwaombea watu wake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.8"
